---
// Bento Grid Magazine: Manchete Principal + 2 Destaques Secundários com imagens locais e links exclusivos
---

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 mb-10">
  <!-- Destaque Principal (Hero 7 cols) -->
  <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
    <a
      href="/noticias/bitcoin-core-mitigacao-dos"
      class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 h-[380px] sm:h-[440px] shadow-sm"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/posts/bitcoin-core.jpg"
        alt="Bitcoin Core e Mitigação de DoS"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-60"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/50 to-transparent"></div>

      <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-orange text-black font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase">
            INFRAESTRUTURA DE REDE
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">Leitura: 3 min</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-amber-400 transition">
          Desenvolvedores lançam atualização do Bitcoin Core para mitigar vetor de DoS
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">
          Nova versão corrige falha na camada de comunicação P2P identificada durante auditoria de buffers de memória em nós completos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Coluna Central: 2 Notícias Médias (5 cols) -->
  <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 gap-5">
    <a
      href="/noticias/phishing-assinaturas-permit2"
      class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 h-[180px] sm:h-[210px] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-end p-5"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/posts/seguranca.jpg"
        alt="Smart Contracts Security"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-50"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/60 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-1.5">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase inline-block">
          SEGURANÇA ON-CHAIN
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-white group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition leading-snug">
          Phishing via assinaturas Permit2: entenda o vetor de ataque em carteiras EVM
        </h2>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/noticias/volume-dex-layer-2"
      class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 h-[180px] sm:h-[210px] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-end p-5"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/posts/layer-2.jpg"
        alt="Layer 2 Rollups"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-50"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/60 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-1.5">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-cyan/20 text-brand-cyan font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase inline-block">
          MERCADO & DEFI
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-white group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition leading-snug">
          Volume em DEXs cresce impulsionado pela redução de taxas em redes Layer 2
        </h2>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
